{"weft":1,"name":"Grey area","keys":{},"code":"// Grey area\nsetcpm(130/4)\n\ndrums: stack(\n  s(\"bd\").struct(\"x ~ ~ ~   x ~ ~ ~   x ~ ~ ~   x ~ ~ ~\").gain(slider(0.43, 0, 1.5)),\n)\n  .bank(\"RolandTR909\")\n  .mask(\"<1!28 0!4 1!16 0!8 1!8>\")\n\nhats: stack(\n  s(\"hh\").struct(\"~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ x ~\").gain(slider(0.26, 0, 1.5)),\n  s(\"rd\").struct(\"x x x x   x x x x   x x x x   x x x x\").gain(slider(0.07, 0, 1.5)),\n)\n  .bank(\"RolandTR909\")\n  .mask(\"<0!8 1!20 0!4 1!16 0!8 1!8>\")\n\nperc: stack(\n  s(\"rim\").struct(\"~ ~ ~ x   ~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ x ~   ~ x ~ ~\").gain(slider(0.23, 0, 1.5)).pan(slider(0.3, 0, 1)),\n  s(\"lt\") .struct(\"~ ~ ~ ~   ~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ ~ ~   ~ x ~ ~\").gain(slider(0.2, 0, 1.5)),\n  s(\"mt\") .struct(\"~ ~ ~ ~   ~ ~ ~ ~   ~ ~ ~ x   ~ ~ ~ ~\").gain(slider(0.17, 0, 1.5)).pan(slider(0.7, 0, 1)),\n)\n  .bank(\"RolandTR909\")\n  .mask(\"<0!16 1!48>\")\n\nopen: stack(\n  s(\"oh\").struct(\"~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ x ~   ~ ~ x ~\").gain(slider(0.2, 0, 1.5)),\n  s(\"cp\").struct(\"~ ~ ~ ~   x ~ ~ ~   ~ ~ ~ ~   x ~ ~ ~\").room(0.2).gain(slider(0.29, 0, 1.5)),\n)\n  .bank(\"RolandTR909\")\n  .mask(\"<0!32 1!16 0!8 1!8>\")\n\nriff: note(`\n  c4  ~   ~   c4    ~   ~   c4  ~     ~   ~   c4  ~     ~   c4  ~   ~ ,\n  d#4 ~   ~   d#4   ~   ~   d#4 ~     ~   ~   d#4 ~     ~   d#4 ~   ~ ,\n  g4  ~   ~   g4    ~   ~   g4  ~     ~   ~   g4  ~     ~   g4  ~   ~\n`)\n  .s(\"sawtooth\")\n  .lpf(sine.range(500, 2600).slow(16))\n  .lpq(slider(10, 0, 30))\n  .lpenv(2).decay(.12).sustain(0)\n  .room(slider(0.25, 0, 1))\n  .delay(.25).delayfeedback(.35)\n  .gain(slider(0.35, 0, 1.5))\n\nbass: note(`\n  ~  ~  c2 ~    ~  ~  c2 ~    ~  ~  c2 ~    ~  c2 c2 ~\n`)\n  .s(\"triangle\")\n  .lpf(slider(260, 100, 8000))\n  .gain(slider(0.46, 0, 1.5))\n  .mask(\"<0!16 1!12 0!4 1!16 0!8 1!8>\")\n","sounds":[]}